			id: "2240000000000001"
			title: "Nuclear Materials Preserve History"
			description: ["NuclearCraft materials are not ordinary alloy ingredients. Isotope, enrichment, irradiation and burnup are part of identity. Matterworks therefore never lets generic chemistry recreate reactor fuel, depleted fuel or waste from a list of elements."]
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.2d
			tasks: [{ id: "3240000000000001", type: "checkmark" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6240000000000001", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2240000000000001"]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2240000000000002"
			title: "A Fission Reactor Is a Heat System"
			description: ["Fuel generates heat; reactor geometry and cooling determine whether that heat can be removed safely. Do not judge a reactor only by RF output. Before activation, understand where heat is produced, which cooling rules are satisfied and what happens when cooling capacity is lost."]
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3240000000000002", type: "checkmark" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6240000000000002", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2240000000000002"]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2240000000000003"
			title: "Fuel Handling Is Part of the Reactor"
			description: ["A controller does not make a complete reactor. The multiblock needs structure and explicit interfaces for fuel and products. Design loading, unloading and shutdown behaviour before continuous operation so a blocked output cannot silently turn into a process failure."]
			x: 5.0d
			y: -1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3240000000000003", type: "checkmark" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6240000000000003", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2240000000000002"]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2240000000000004"
			title: "Control Before Optimisation"
			description: ["Matterworks places digital process control before nuclear engineering for a reason. Establish measured state, alarms and a safe shutdown path first; optimise fuel utilisation or power density only after the reactor can be supervised predictably."]
			x: 5.0d
			y: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3240000000000004", type: "checkmark" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6240000000000004", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2240000000000003", "2240000000000004"]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2240000000000005"
			title: "Accelerators Are Beam Systems"
			description: ["An accelerator is not one transmutation block. It needs magnetic focusing, a controlled structure, an ion source and a beam path. Phase 6 follows that physical sequence explicitly, and Matterworks removes shortcuts that would turn the accelerator into a bulk resource generator."]
			x: 7.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			tasks: [{ id: "3240000000000005", type: "checkmark" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6240000000000005", type: "xp", xp: 75 }]
		}
	]
	title: "Guide - NuclearCraft Engineering"
